      },
      {
        "text": "The development of these vaccines was made possible through strong public-private collaboration.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The vaccines developed under Operation Warp Speed have efficacy rates in the 70s, 80s, and 90s.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Historically, similar vaccine development has taken up to four years.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The scale and pace of Operation Warp Speed are comparable to the Manhattan Project.",
        "confidence": 0.92
