    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74275.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "But again, our tribes have been incredible partners. in all this, and it's given us a tool that other people don't have, and I'm very proud of them for the stepping up. And again, I think our state effort has been well led, and so we're trying, but if you looked at it demographically, we have a lot of the same groups that nationally are more resistant. And so we're just gonna have to work at it, but at the end of the day, I'm proud of what we're trying to do.",
