      },
      {
        "text": "The pandemic revealed previously unrecognized systemic weaknesses in public health infrastructure.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts the recipient’s judgment on the quality of spending due to their involvement.",
        "confidence": 0.91
