    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74275.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "Now, while you're talking about the budget proposal from the Biden administration, I want to ask you about the proposal that they've come forward with to invest $6.5 billion in a new agency, ARPA-H, it's modeled after a DARPA at the Defense Department, but it's meant to accelerate through NIH, through the National Institutes of Health, accelerate public-private partnerships that will bring forward better solutions on cancer, Alzheimer's, other chronic diseases. Your thoughts on that?",
