        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Investing in biomedical research leads to tangible improvements in treating major chronic diseases.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker’s question is framed as seeking informed opinion, implying the listener holds relevant expertise or perspective.",
