    "turn_text": "Thank you. One point I want to raise here, there is a risk in this current very overheated controversy that some of our folks like Dr. Fauci and some of our scientists who were partners in what were legitimate research efforts, partnerships in China that That the environs becoming overly politicized. There's been quite an increase in the attacks upon Dr. Fauci coming from former President Trump, from others, recently, members of Congress and others. What's your view on that? That seems to be a pretty dangerous phenomenon. I think it's very",
