    "turn_text": "Thank you and I'm very heartened by what you've said in defense of Dr. Fauci. That's terribly important. In the Biden administration's budget proposal for FY 22, 2022, they're proposing 10 billion for global health. And within that envelope of 10 billion, there's a billion for global health security, which the understanding is that this will be in the regular budget for several years going out. That's an important step, it seems to me. in moving the butt to or towards that type of budget measure. And within that one billion is 250 million that will go towards the early stages of a pandemic financing effort, still in the works in terms of negotiations and the like. But let's start out, first of all, your thoughts on this move to build into the normal budgeting process, a billion a year for global health security.",
